  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - .",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted numbered 7672/12, 7672/15, 7672/16, 7672/18, Design & Access Statement Received 30/09/2010 and 7672/13A, 7672/17A Received 06/10/2010 and 7672/17D Received 02/11/2010  therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - No additional floorspace shall be formed within the buildings hereby permitted by means of internal horizontal division without prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - No machinery shall be operated, no process shall be carried out and no deliveries taken at or despatched from the site outside the following times 07:00-19:00 Monday-Friday, 08:00-13:00 Saturdays, nor at any time on Sundays, Bank or Public Holidays.",
    "Condition : 6 - Before first occupation of the buildings the loading, unloading and turning space, and parking spaces (including space for people with disabilities) shall be provided within the curtilage of the site in accordance with the scheme shown on drawing SK-002 A and such spaces shall be permanently available and not be used for any other purpose (including any additional external storage).",
    "Condition : 7 - A Considerate Operators Management Plan, which should include a Noise Management Plan, for the operational uses of the site shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority in writing prior to first occupation of the building. These details shall be carried out as approved.",
    "Condition : 8 - All external lighting shall be directed downwards and not exceed the current lux levels of the existing external lights. Any additional external lighting would require prior approval in writing from the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 9 - Before first occupation of the building, a Travel Plan shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. Such a travel plan shall be undertaken and maintained as approved."
